      "rejected_notes": [
        "Compare model `ph` only with GLODAP pH **on the total scale at in-situ temperature and pressure**: check in `configs/datasets.yaml` which field that is (`pHtsinsitutp` vs `pHts25p0`); a 25 °C / 0 dbar pH is a different quantity and must be stated if used.",
        "`dissic` and `talk` are per volume (mol m-3) with `talk` including carbonate, nitrogen, silicate and borate components; convert to µmol kg-1 before any comparison (see `cmip6-bgc-units-per-volume`), and flag that the CESM2 paper does not document its carbonate constants as an unverified assumption."
      ]
